# Forum Threads API Test

### Get all forum threads
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads

### Get threads by category
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/category/{{categoryId}}

### Search threads
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/search?q=period

### Get thread by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/{{threadId}}

### Create a new thread
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Best natural remedies for period cramps",
  "content": "I've been experiencing severe cramps lately and looking for natural remedies...",
  "forumId": "{{forumId}}",
  "isPinned": true,
  "isLocked": false
}

### Update a thread
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/{{threadId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated: Best natural remedies for period cramps",
  "content": "I've been experiencing severe cramps lately and looking for natural remedies. Any suggestions?"
}

### Pin a thread
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/{{threadId}}/pin

### Lock a thread
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/{{threadId}}/lock

### Delete a thread
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/{{threadId}}
